corrective_lesson:incident:upstream_dependency_failure
An upstream dependency returned a server error. That is a real failure of the dependency, but it does not by itself establish whether this operation completed, so its outcome still has to be verified. Establish the operation's own outcome from an authoritative record before accepting or rejecting the result, and record which upstream dependency returned the error.
